<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow pill">BENGALURU, LET'S FIND YOUR CORNER.</span><h1>Find a PG that<br>feels like <em>home.</em></h1><p>Discover real PG accommodation across <%= localities.join(", ") %>. Compare rent, room types, amenities, and locations before deciding where to stay.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/listings">Explore PGs ↗</a><% if(!user||user.role!=='user'){ %><a class="quiet" href="/list-property">List your PG →</a><% } %></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="tiny-house">⌂</span><span>A new city. A new chapter.<br><strong>A place to call yours.</strong></span></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Decorative architectural illustration, not a property photograph" role="img"><div class="art-grid"></div><span class="art-caption">A LITTLE CLOSER TO HOME</span><div class="house"><div class="roof"></div><div class="window one"></div><div class="window two"></div><div class="door"></div><div class="steps"></div></div><div class="sun"></div><div class="plant"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="art-label"><span>⌖</span><div>Rooted in Bengaluru<small><%= localities.join(" · ") %></small></div></div><span class="art-foot">ROOM FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER.</span></div></section><section class="search-section"><%- include('partials/search') %><p class="search-note">Your locality. Your budget. Your kind of space.</p></section><section><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">GOOD PLACES, NEW BEGINNINGS</span><h2>Find your next home.</h2><p>Explore approved local listings, as they become available.</p></div><a class="quiet" href="/listings">Explore all PGs ↗</a></div><%- include('partials/cards') %></section><section class="directory-home"><div><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE RAJANUKUNTE & NEARBY</span><h2>Your neighbourhood, on the map.</h2><p>Browse publicly sourced PGs around Presidency University. Check each source and confirm current details directly.</p></div><a class="button" href="/directory/rajanukunte">PG directory & free map ↗</a></section><section class="localities"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL NEIGHBOURHOODS. PLENTY OF POSSIBILITY.</span><h2>Where do you want to be?</h2></div></div><div class="locality-grid"><% for(const [index,locality] of localities.entries()){ %><a href="/listings?area=<%= encodeURIComponent(locality) %>" class="locality <%= locality.toLowerCase() %>"><span class="locality-number"><%= String(index+1).padStart(2,"0") %> / BENGALURU</span><h3><%= locality %> <span>↗</span></h3><p><%= locality==='Rajanukunte'?'Browse owner listings and the public PG directory.':'Explore approved PG listings and confirm the details directly with the owner.' %></p><span class="locality-line">Find your space in <%= locality %> →</span></a><% } %></div></section><section><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SPACE, YOUR WAY</span><h2>What feels like you?</h2><div class="shortcut-grid"><% for(const [label,key,value] of [["Men's PG",'category','Men'],["Women's PG",'category','Women'],['Co-living','category','Co-living'],['Single sharing','sharing','Single'],['Double sharing','sharing','Double'],['Triple sharing','sharing','Triple'],['Food included','foodIncluded','yes'],['Wi-Fi','amenity','Wi-Fi'],['Laundry','amenity','Laundry']]){ %><a href="/listings?<%= key %>=<%= encodeURIComponent(value) %>"><%= label %> <span>↗</span></a><% } %></div></section><section class="why"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY GOES A LONG WAY</span><h2>Less guesswork.<br>More feeling at home.</h2><p>Useful details to help you make a decision that feels right.</p></div><div class="benefits"><% for(const [n,h,p] of [['01','Compare the details','Rent, sharing options, meals and amenities in one place.'],['02','See real property photographs','Owner-authorized photos, reviewed before publication.'],['03','Start a conversation','Send an inquiry or request a visit directly to the owner.'],['04','Stay close to your everyday','Explore PGs in your preferred Bengaluru locality.']]){ %><div><span><%= n %></span><h3><%= h %></h3><p><%= p %></p></div><% } %></div></section><section><span class="eyebrow">FROM SEARCH TO SETTLING IN</span><h2>Three steps closer.</h2><div class="steps-grid"><% for(const [n,h,p] of [['01','Choose your neighbourhood','Start with the locality that works for your daily life.'],['02','Find your kind of space','Compare property details, rent and facilities.'],['03','Meet your next home','Contact the owner or request a visit before deciding.']]){ %><div><span class="step-number"><%= n %></span><h3><%= h %></h3><p><%= p %></p></div><% } %></div></section><% if(!user||user.role!=='user'){ %><section class="owner-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">GOOD HOMES DESERVE TO BE FOUND</span><h2>Have a PG to list?</h2><p>Introduce your property to people looking for their next home.</p></div><a class="button" href="/signup?role=owner&next=/owner/new">Get started as an owner ↗</a></section><% } %><%- include('partials/footer') %>